Cell["\<\
If input indices are given not in an increasing order or repeated indices \
appear or there appears index, which exceeds dimension of vector space of the \
algebra, then error message is produced and input is not interpreted as basis \
elements. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cdd29047-8455-4da0-a975-df19a98b9692"],

