Cell["\<\
Perti Lounesto notes in \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]What is bivector\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] in Proceedings of the Second Max Born Symposium held \
near Wroc\[LSlash]aw, Poland, September 1992, p 153-158, that neither left \
nor right contraction coincides with inner product of Hestenes&Sobczyk for \
general multivectors. This is clearly seen by calculating the following \
products given as an example in that article \
\>", "Text",
