436c010d0302"],

Cell["\<\
We are attempting to implement Clifford algebras over noncommutative \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]fields\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] (rings).  This is \
highly experimental feature. Only  basis operations are supported (products, \
grade, component selection, etc.)  Elements of coefficient \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]field\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]  are multiplied either \
by geometric or by commutative product (no other products: \
OuterProduct,InnerProduct, LeftContract, RightContract are  defined for \
coefficients).  Clifford algebra elements always commute with coefficient \
algebra elements. The purpose of this extension is to enable basis operations \
over tensor product of two Clifford algebras (the result of such a product is \
not a Clifford algebra in general).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.531215444705543*^9, 3.531215453183996*^9}, {
   3.531215728886285*^9, 3.531215752489262*^9}, {3.531215819529191*^9, 
