Cell[TextData[{
 "Field elements after evaluation are represented as a quaternions (bold \
double struck \[DoubleStruckE]), whereas main Clifford algebra elements are \
colored. Looking at  ",
 StyleBox["gaNonCommutativeFieldElementPattern",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " we see how these field (in general noncommutative ring) elements are \
represented internally.  We assume, that field element\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
grade is always zero when computing grades or components of main algebra \
expressions. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.93980478256707*^9, 
  3.939805088550808*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0b1cf2c2-ef43-4a07-bb7c-\
ed65895785e3"],

